{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"0820c676ad433f3511909fd6951fb4fcc4ff6d4c48e9ee637e3a4d5e7b84f784","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["年輕時要記住你的創造主，不要等到衰老的歲月來臨時才哀歎：「我的日子毫無樂趣。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，太陽、月亮、星星都暗淡無光，雨後烏雲再現；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["守衛家園的手腳顫抖，強壯的身軀變得彎腰駝背；牙齒稀少，無法咀嚼；視力衰退，看不清楚；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耳朵發背，聽不到推磨聲；小鳥一叫，人就起來；歌聲沙啞，不再美妙；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["懼怕高處，走路戰戰兢兢；頭髮白如銀杏，精力枯竭，慾望蕩然無存；人都走向永遠的歸宿，弔喪的人往來於街上；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["銀鏈斷裂，金碗摔壞，泉旁的瓶子破碎，井口的輪子朽爛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那時塵土必歸回大地，靈也要歸回賜靈的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["傳道者說：「虛空的虛空，一切都是虛空。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["傳道者不但有智慧，還把知識傳授給眾人。他經過細心推敲和研究之後，編寫了許多警世的箴言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["傳道者費盡心思尋找金玉良言，所寫的都是正直誠實的道理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["智者的言語好像趕牛的刺棍，他們收集的箴言像釘牢的釘子，都是一位牧者所賜的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我親愛的兒子，還有一件事，你要聽我的忠告：著書多，沒有窮盡；讀書多，身體疲勞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["以上所說的，總而言之，就是要敬畏上帝，遵守祂的誡命，這是人的本分。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因為人一切的行為，無論善惡，包括一切隱秘事，上帝都必審問。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}